Cell["\<\
Clearly Newton\[CloseCurlyQuote]s method has converged to the correct value \
of the Golden Ratio in a few iterations.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9089113006972055`*^9, 3.908911342920503*^9}, {
  3.9089690465707517`*^9, 
  3.9089690491222324`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c308aa33-60c7-40b2-aa86-\
7e8f0aa35c79"],

